outweighs the 11 per day saved on fixed costs.\n- **Daily (6):** fixed cost is 45 per day. Lower holding saves only about 9 per day, so it comes out behind.\n\n**Within the 2-day group, by order size:**\n- **5:** about 42 of item 0 per order (close to expected demand) and about 1.2× expected for item 1. This fits the high cost of running short best.\n- **7 and 1:** a little smaller. Plan 7 also cuts its final orders, which reduces stock wasted at the end.\n- **2:** item 0 about right, item 1 about at expected demand.\n- **4:** below expected demand for both items, so it loses more to shortages."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4562, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4562}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:55:11.806Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVTZFTGkDekwrr6RdNMH"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_014JgwzhzVdxsesgNJAuNAsC", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVTZFm8XNYwXExqsTQgP", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_014JgwzhzVdxsesgNJAuNAsC", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.45, 0.68, 0.5, 0.15, 0.3, 0.8, 0.3, 0.75]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_i