out 9, so a margin of about 10–15% looks right. A margin of 20% risks write-offs and overflow when the large order arrives around day 22 (candidate 5).\n   - Candidate 4 orders exactly the forecast, which is effectively below expected demand because the multiplier averages 1.046.\n   - Candidate 7 has a margin of about 15% and cuts orders at the end of the month, which is sensible because leftover stock is worth nothing.\n   - Candidate 1 has a margin of about 10% on both goods.\n   - Candidate 2 has a 20% margin on good 0 but none on good 1.\n   - Candidate 5 has a 20% margin on both and the highest overflow risk.\n\nMy estimated ranking: 7 and 1 are the most likely to be in the top half, then 5, 2 and 0 are close, then 4, with 6 and 3 at the bottom."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4734, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4734}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:55:59.379Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVTbNDd8cK5zqKFt5A2j"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01TsqSV1dmZQ2ogC3JjEU1CZ", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVTbNSH8gz7KyFQY45io", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01TsqSV1dmZQ2ogC3JjEU1CZ", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.42, 0.72, 0.55, 0.1, 0.32, 0.55, 0.15, 0.75]}, 